{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Restaurant", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Evening With Friends", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > World of Food > Talking Around Food", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making Plans for the Evening", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use modals or the simple present tense to make offers and invitations, such as <span class = \"italic\">\"Would you like to \u2026 ?\"</span> or  <span class = \"italic\">\"Do you feel like \u2026 ?\"<br/> You can also use modals and the simple present tense to accept or decline invitations.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Making Offers</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Accepting</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Declining</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Do you feel like ... ?</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Would you like to ... ?</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">We should ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sure!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Great idea!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">That sounds good!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I would love to!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I would love to, but \u2026</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thanks for the offer, but \u2026</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No, thanks. I don't feel like \u2026 </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " In polite conversations, it is important to thank people when you accept their invitation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Thanking People</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Responding to Thanks</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Formal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thank you so much!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">You shouldn't have!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">This is really kind/sweet of you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">My pleasure.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">You're very welcome.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Don't mention it!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Informal</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Thanks!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Cheers!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sure.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No worries.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">It's nothing.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class = \"italic\">\"I'm sorry\"</span> to apologize if you refuse an invitation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Apologizing</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Responding to Apologies</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Sorry/So sorry ...</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm sorry to hear that.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I apologize ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Don't worry about it!</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">It's okay.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">That's okay.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">Maybe next time!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can use verbs with infinitives to be more specific about the reason for accepting or refusing an offer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'm sorry. I can't make it because I have to go to the doctor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I would love to come to the party.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "most of the time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very often; usually", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I eat at home most of the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words for review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "every other day", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one day out of two", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I go to yoga every other day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cheese", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a solid food made from milk", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The 4-cheese pizza is delicious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le01ob11aud03", "type":